    "body": "More customers. More loads. More decisions that affect your bottom line. As your brokerage grows, it becomes harder to know whether the additional volume is delivering the profit you expect. The New Rules of Freight Brokerage explores why margin discipline is becoming a competitive advantage, and five practical rules to help you stay in control as your operation expands.\nDownload the guide to explore:\nWhy revenue growth doesn’t always translate into stronger profitability.\nWhere everyday decisions can quietly put margins at risk.\nWhat your team needs to make more informed, consistent decisions.\nHow to recognize when growth is outpacing your operational controls.\nGet a clearer perspective on what it takes to build a more profitable brokerage. Download the free guide !",
